            "id": "bfa8-d410-b8b6-7add",
            "description": "The albino direwolf known as Ghost could not be more aptly named, trailing in Jon Snow's wake like an ominous shadow. On the battlefield, Ghost ranges more or less freely, having an instinctive grasp of his master's will. Capable of shocking speed and rending through armor with his powerful jaws, Ghost operates best as a flanker or in pursuit of broken troops. Indeed, the sight of a charging direwolf is enough to shake most men to their core.",
