            "name": "Description",
            "id": "6fab-ebe7-38a4-5bdb",
            "description": "The Night's Watch Builders are known for their ingenuity, and none embodies this more than the Builder Scorpion Crew. With just a few specialized parts, and enough available timer, the Crew can construct a mobile Scorpion, capable of firing massive bolts at long range and with surpirising accuracy. Entire ranks can be cut down by a single projective. However the Scorpion itself requires time to reposition, and it moves very slowly.",
            "hidden": false
          },
          {
            "name": "War Machine",
            "id": "7741-155c-6155-be06",
            "description": "This model has 6 wounds.\nThis model never makes Morale Tests, cannot Charge or Retreat, and cannot gain Condition Tokens.",
            "hidden": false
          },
