            "name": "Bolt Thrower",
            "id": "fba6-777e-b0d1-f66e",
            "description": "- Long Range\n- May not Shift before Attack.\n- Sundering (Defenders suffer -2 to Defense Save rolls)\n- Volley: each success deals 3 hits.\n- Single: If this generates any Hits on a Solo unit, instead of rolling Wound Dice, they suffer D3 +1 Wounds.",
